# Golden fixture media (personal photos/video/audio) — kept local only, never in git.
# GitHub also hard-rejects any file >100MB without Git LFS; the reference video alone is ~190MB.
# Only the small text fixtures (script, emotion brief) are tracked.
assets/test/*
!assets/test/*.txt
!assets/test/*.md
